on (NFA) and the Financial Industry Regulatory Authority (FINRA) which indicate that they are regulated and supervised by these organizations.\n\n/u/CruxHub: That\'s very thorough, Alice. Thanks for your analysis. These insights will definitely help us in our research on Citadel.', 'temperature': 0.0, 'best_of': 1, 'max_tokens': 1204, 'logprobs': None, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}}
