{'model': '/data/model/deepseek-aiDeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B', 'prompt': 'Based on the information provided in the first content, the following are potential headings for an article about Deed of Novation:\n\n1. What is a Deed of Novation?\n2. How is a Deed of Novation different from a Contract?\n3. Why Engage a Commercial Contract Lawyer to Review a Deed of Novation?\n4. The Purpose of a Deed of Novation\n5. Options when Deciding How to Address a Novation\n6. Risks Associated with a Deed of Novation\n7. How to Draft a Deed of Novation\n8. How a Deed of Novation Needs to be Signed\n\nThese headings could be adjusted or combined as necessary to create a well-structured and informative article.', 'temperature': 0.0, 'best_of': 1, 'max_tokens': 1050, 'logprobs': None, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}}
{'model': '/data/model/deepseek-aiDeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B', 'prompt': "In this conversation, Tom and the allergist discuss treatment options for Tom's son, Thomas, who has a dairy allergy and environmental allergies. The allergist explains two forms of treatment: allergy shots and sublingual immunotherapy (SLIT). While allergy shots require weekly injections for around 45 weeks, then monthly injections for three to five years, SLIT involves administering a drop under the tongue for three years. SLIT is often more suitable for young children and those who cannot tolerate shots. The allergist also explains that food allergies and environmental allergies cannot be mixed in the same treatment, so they must be addressed separately.\n\nTom expresses interest in SLIT for Thomas's environmental allergies, and inquires about combining SLIT with dairy treatment. The allergist says that it's not possible to combine food and environmental allergies in the same treatment. They discuss the possibility of doing a Western Washington environmental panel blood test and testing for casein, a common protein in milk, to get a better understanding of Thomas's allergies. The allergist suggests Tom get the most up-to-date information on Thomas's allergies and sends him a lab order to get the necessary tests done.", 'temperature': 0.0, 'best_of': 1, 'max_tokens': 1554, 'logprobs': None, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}}
