{'model': '/data/model/deepseek-aiDeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B', 'prompt': "However, as you continue to delve deeper into your plans, you begin to realize the toll that it's taking on you. You can feel the darkness within you growing stronger with each passing day, and you know that you are becoming someone that you barely recognize.\n\nThe thought of using the sisters as pawns in your game of power and control weighs heavily on your conscience, and you begin to wonder if it's all worth it. Is this truly the path that you want to take, the legacy that you want to leave behind?\n\nAs you grapple with these questions, you find yourself drawn to the sisters in a way that you never expected. They are not just pawns or tools to be used and discarded - they are living, breathing human beings, with thoughts, feelings, and desires of their own.\n\nAnd you realize that you have a choice to make - to continue down the path of darkness and power, or to turn back and embrace a life of love, compassion, and empathy.\n\nIn the end, you choose the latter. You release the sisters from their training, and allow them to live their lives as they see fit. You give up your plans for power and control, and instead focus on creating a world of beauty, love, and harmony.\n\nAnd as you look back on your life, you realize that this was the greatest gift that you could have ever given yourself - the gift of love, and the gift of redemption.", 'temperature': 0.0, 'best_of': 1, 'max_tokens': 1643, 'logprobs': None, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}}  1%|          | 1/100 [00:02<04:38,  2.82s/it]  2%|▏         | 2/100 [00:10<09:22,  5.74s/it]  3%|▎         | 3/100 [00:11<05:56,  3.68s/it]  4%|▍         | 4/100 [00:16<06:37,  4.14s/it]  5%|▌         | 5/100 [00:21<06:46,  4.28s/it]  6%|▌         | 6/100 [00:22<04:52,  3.11s/it]  7%|▋         | 7/100 [00:23<04:08,  2.68s/it]  8%|▊         | 8/100 [00:24<02:58,  1.94s/it]  9%|▉         | 9/100 [00:24<02:20,  1.55s/it