{'model': '/data/model/deepseek-aiDeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B', 'prompt': "Transcript 4:\n\nIntroduce yourself (Basic intro of respondent and demographics)\n\n1. I am Anjali and I hail from Delhi, India. Currently I am a student pursuing my graduation\n\nWhich channel do you prefer while shopping for apparel, offline or online?\n2. I prefer offline as I like to try and feel the clothes before making a purchase\n\nWhat type of products do you generally buy online/offline?\n3. I buy mostly books and electronics online while I buy apparel, groceries and cosmetics offline\n\nWhat is the purchase frequency for your apparel purchases?\n4. I purchase apparel whenever I require them. Sometimes it's once a month and sometimes once in 3 months\n\nWhat type of apparel you love to purchase more frequently?\n5. I love purchasing dresses and tops more frequently as they are easy to style and can be worn for different occasions\n\nWhy do you prefer while buying - online or offline? What parameters do you look at while buying?\n6. I prefer offline as I can try the clothes before making a purchase. I look at the fit, quality, style, and price while buying.\n\nDo you see prices online while buying offline or vice versa for comparison?\n7. Yes, I do check online prices before making a purchase offline. If I find a better deal online, I might purchase it from there instead of offline.\n\nWhat factors influence your decision for an apparel purchase?\n8. Fit, Quality, Style, Price, and Brand influence my decision for an apparel purchase.", 'temperature': 0.0, 'best_of': 1, 'max_tokens': 1119, 'logprobs': None, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}}
{'model': '/data/model/deepseek-aiDeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B', 'prompt': '```\nfunction generateRaceSentence(race: any) {\n    let secondHorse = race.Horses.filter(x => x.Name !== race.Horses[0].Name)[0]\n    return `In the racecode "${race.RaceCode}" held on ${race.Date} at ${race.RaceTrackName}, ${race.Horses[0].Name} finished in ${race.Position} place and ${secondHorse.Name} finished in ${secondHorse.Position} place`;\n}\n```\nThis function first filter the horse that came second by comparing the name of the first horse and the name of other horses in the array and then generate the sentence by using the name of the first horse and the second horse and their position.\n\nNote: The output of this function is only correct if the JSON file is in the correct format, and all the horses have a position in the race and the name of the horses are unique.', 'temperature': 0.0, 'best_of': 1, 'max_tokens': 1053, 'logprobs': None, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}}
{'model': '/data/model/deepseek-aiDeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B', 'prompt': '1/3 코드 부분\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\nimport numpy as np\nimport re\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split, StratifiedKFold, GridSearchCV\nfrom sklearn.metrics import f1_score\nfrom imblearn.over_sampling import SMOTE\nfrom gensim.models import FastText\nfrom nltk.corpus import stopwords\nfrom nltk.tokenize import word_tokenize\nfrom lightgbm import LGBMClassifier\nfrom tqdm.auto import tqdm\nimport torch\nfrom torch.utils.data import Dataset, DataLoader\nfrom transformers import AutoTokenizer, AutoModelForSequenceClassification, AdamW, get_linear_schedule_with_warmup\n\n# Data preprocessing\ndef preprocess_text(text):\n    text = re.sub(r"//.*", "", text)\n    text = re.sub(r"http\\S+|www\\S+\n```', 'temperature': 0.0, 'best_of': 1, 'max_tokens': 1190, 'logprobs': None, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}}
