{'model': '/data/model/deepseek-aiDeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B', 'prompt': 'Sure, here are the logic steps for the given API call:\n\n1. Verify the access token provided in the Authorization header.\n2. Retrieve the usecase with name "Social Media Monitoring".\n3. Retrieve all rules associated with the usecase.\n4. For each rule, retrieve all classification categories associated with it.\n5. For each classification category, retrieve all conditions associated with it.\n6. For each condition, retrieve all sub-conditions associated with it.\n7. For each content submitted in the `sync submit` call, run it against all sub-conditions associated with the respective condition within a classification category in the rule.\n8. If all the sub-conditions associated with at least one condition in a classification category for a rule are satisfied for a content, then it means the classification category for that rule has been met.\n9. If all the classification categories associated with a rule have been met for a content, then trigger the action associated with the rule.\n10. Create an analysis object for each content with its respective analysis result and store it in the database.\n11. Return a response with the analysis result for each content.', 'temperature': 0.0, 'best_of': 1, 'max_tokens': 1274, 'logprobs': None, 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}}
